RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"46\" height=\"50\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">4명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"243\" height=\"50\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴돋움&quot;\">메</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">디컬․IT융합공학과는 2012학년도 신설예정 학과로서 학과신설 전까지 전자공학부 소속</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">2. 응모자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교육공무원 임용에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 마감일 현재 초빙분야의 박사학위 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 접수 마감일을 기준으로 최근 4년 이내(20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">07. 6. 9~2011. 6.10) 박사학위 논문을 포함하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 2편 이상의 국내․외전문학술지[SCI(E), SSCI, A&amp;HCI 등재] 또는 국외전문학술지[SCI(E), SSCI, A&amp;HCI 미등재], 국내전문학술지[한국연구재단등재(후보)]에 게재 논문이 있는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 석․박사학위 논문은 기간 제한 없음&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">3. 임용조건 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">최종합격자는 교육공무원법 제11조의3 규정에 의거 2011년 9월 1일자 교육공무원으로 임용될 예정이며,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교육과학기술부의 국립대학 교원보수관련 규정에 따라</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">성과급적 연봉제</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">적용대상 임</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">4. 제출서류 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">[아래 순으로 편철하여 제출] </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 교수초빙 지원서 1부 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 본교 교수초빙 홈페이지(<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\"><a href=\"http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr</font></a></span>) 에서 지원서 접수 후 출력</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 100.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -100.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 편철순서 : ①지원서표지(다운로드 후 작성) → ②지원서 출력물(인적사항, 학위, 경력, 대표논문, 연구실적물) → ③자기소개서(다운로드 후 작성)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학력 및 성적증명서(학사, 석사, 박사) 원본 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">(외국대학에서 학위를 취득한 경우는 학위증 사본과 본인이 날인한 국문 번역본 제출)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 50.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -50.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 경력(재직)증명서 (지원서에 입력한 모든 경력) 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 외국어로 된 증명서는 본인이 날인한 번역문을 첨부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 37.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">부득이 사본을 제출한 경우에는 원본과 대조할 수 있도록 원본을 지참하여 확인을 받고, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">본인이 서명한 후 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 외국대학 조교 및 연구원 등 경력증명서 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">해당 대학 총장이 발급한 경력증명서(임용직명, 임용기간, 근무기간, 보수 등을 명시)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">부득이 해당 대학 총장이 발급한 경력증명서를 제출하지 못할 경우에는 임용권자(책임자)가 발급한 경력증명서 제출(임용직명, 임용기간, 근무기간, 구체적 업무내용, 보수 등을 명시)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">대학에서 근무한 연구원, 연구(장학)조교 등의 경력은 상근/급여지급 증빙서 첨부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">석ㆍ</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">박사 학위논문 1부 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">마. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">연구실적물 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -22.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 최근 4년 이내(20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">07.6.9~2011.6.10)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 게재(발행)된 실적물 원본 또는 별쇄본 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 40.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 연구실적물별로 SCI(E), SSCI, A&amp;HCI등재지, 국외학술지 및 한국연구재단</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">등재(후보)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">지를 확인할 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">수 있는 서류(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">발표연</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">월, 논문 제목, 권(호), 페이지 범위 등이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 가능한 출력물의 사본 또는 온라인 논문검색 결과 출력물)를 첨부할 것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 40.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 대표실적물 지정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">연구실적물 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">‘채용분야별 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">세부평가기준’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">을 참고하여 최대 4편까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">대표실적물로 지정할 수 있음.(대표실적물 미지정시 심사에 불이익이 발생 할 수 있음.)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">5. 지원서 접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;가. 접수 방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 금오공과대학교 교수초빙 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr</font></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">)에서 인터넷 접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt; TEXT-INDENT: -40pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 인터넷 접수 출력물(지원서표지~자기소개서)을 포함한 제출서류는 직접 또는 우편으로 제출하며, 접수마감일시까지 도착한 것에 한함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 우편접수 시 반드시 봉투에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">지원 학부(과)/분야</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">를 기재할 것&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 기간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 인터넷 접수 : 2011. 5.31(화) ~ 6.10(금) 09:00 ~ 18:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 방문서류접수 : 2011. 6. 8(수) ~ 6.10(금) 09:00 ~ 18:00 (인터넷 접수자에 한함) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 한국시간 기준</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 접수처 및 주소&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 접수처 : 금오공과대학교 교무연구처 교수지원팀(본관 2층 201호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">주 소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 본관 201호 교무연구처(교수지원팀)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;730-701</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">6. 기 타</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본 공고에 명시되지 않은 사항은 교육공무원법 등 관계 법령 및 본교 인사관련 규정에 의함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">지원서 입력 및 구비서류의 허위, 착오, 누락, 미비 등으로 인해 심사에 불이익이 발생할 경우에는 본인이 책임을 지며, 허위 사실로 확인될 경우 임용을 취소할 수 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 인터넷 접수 후에도 서류제출 마감일까지 서류 미제출할 경우 접수를 취소함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">모든 채용 분야에 중복 지원 불가하며 적격자가 없을 경우 초빙하지 않을 수 있음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 제출된 서류는 요청이 있을 경우, 2011년 11월 이후 반환 함. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">임용 교원은 최초 계약기간 동안 매학기 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">1강좌 이상의 전공과목 영어강의를 하여야 함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;사.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">기타 상세한 사항은 교수초빙 홈페이지(<a href=\"http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">http://kitin.kumoh.ac.kr</font></a>)를 통해 확인하시고, 문의사항은 본교 교무연구처 교수지원팀으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 교수채용 담당자 연락처 : 전화 (054)478-7025 / 팩스 (054)478-7034</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\">2011년 5월 17일</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 26pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">&nbsp;금오공과대학교총장</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
